  "prefLabel": "Agr 3503.01 Emergency veterinary treatment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 3503.01 Emergency veterinary treatment. Application for reimbursement of emergency veterinary treatment shall:\n\n(a) Be made as part of the regular application process;\n\n(b) Be accompanied by a written statement from a veterinarian currently licensed pursuant to RSA 332-B indicating that the specific treatment was necessary and appropriate;\n\n(c) Be capped at $500 per animal; and\n\n(d) Be capped at $5000 per court case.\n\nSource. #13208, eff 6-1-2121 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Agr 3500)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr3500.html"
